exports[`Arrival table — conformance > DOM snapshots per fixture state > 1024x640 · 1-fresh_account 1`] = `"<div role="dialog" aria-modal="false" aria-labelledby=":id:" aria-describedby=":id:" data-world-place="commons" data-compact="true" data-reduced-motion="false"><header><div><p>The work folio on the arrival table</p><h2 id=":id:" tabindex="-1">Arrival table</h2><p>Host: Orchestrator — the orchestrator; selecting another agent adds context, it does not assign them</p><p role="status" data-state-tone="ok"><span aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Evidence read just now.</span></p></div><button aria-label="Close Arrival table" class="pa-btn pa-btn--bare"><span class="pa-btn__label">×</span></button></header><dl data-orchestrator-facts="read" aria-label="Orchestrator: current state"><div data-fact="configured" data-value="unknown"><dt>Configured</dt><dd>Not reported</dd><dd>The status route does not report model configuration.</dd></div><div data-fact="reachable" data-value="reachable"><dt>Reachable</dt><dd>Reachable</dd><dd>Status route answered: idle.</dd></div><div data-fact="ready" data-value="unknown"><dt>Ready</dt><dd>Unconfirmed</dd><dd>A reachable daemon is not proof a model can answer.</dd></div><div data-fact="activelyUsed" data-value="none_attributed_in_window"><dt>Actively used</dt><dd>Nothing attributed in this window</dd><dd>No task in flight at the time of reading.</dd></div></dl><div><button data-place-primary="true" data-action="prepare_brief" aria-describedby=":id:" aria-expanded="false" class="pa-btn pa-btn--primary"><span class="pa-btn__label">Prepare a brief</span></button><div role="group" aria-label="More actions"><button data-action="sit_together" title="Changes seating and camera only. Voice is a separate control; text stays available." class="pa-btn pa-btn--ghost"><span class="pa-btn__label">Sit together</span></button><button data-action="review_decision" title="Opens the Decision Inbox. Nothing is approved from the World." class="pa-btn pa-btn--ghost"><span class="pa-btn__label">Review a decision</span></button><button data-action="resume_conversation" title="Opens the canonical shared chat. Offered only when a real session exists." class="pa-btn pa-btn--ghost" disabled=""><span class="pa-btn__label">Resume conversation</span></button><button data-action="open_profile" title="Shows the shared agent profile: what it can do, what was reported, and the evidence." class="pa-btn pa-btn--ghost"><span class="pa-btn__label">Open profile</span></button><button data-action="explore_places" title="Opens the Places list. Every place works without walking." class="pa-btn pa-btn--ghost"><span class="pa-btn__label">Explore places</span></button></div><p id=":id:">Write the outcome, context, constraints and what would count as done. Nothing is sent until you choose Send. Escape closes the most recent layer.</p><p data-disabled-reason="resume_conversation">Resume conversation: no conversation is open on the daemon yet.</p></div><section data-place-empty="true" aria-label="Nothing is in progress yet"><p>Nothing is in progress yet</p><p>Prepare a brief to start. It stays a draft until you send it.</p></section><div><div><section aria-labelledby="world-slot-orchestrator" data-slot="orchestrator" data-slot-state="ready" data-stale="false"><h4><span><span id="world-slot-orchestrator">Orchestrator status</span><span>Read just now</span></span></h4><p>Orchestrator reports “idle” · 0 task(s) in flight.</p><p>No open conversation to continue.</p></section><details data-slot="requests" data-slot-state="empty" data-stale="false"><summary><span><span id="world-slot-requests">Recent requests</span><span>Read just now</span></span></summary><p>The orchestrator reports no recent tasks.</p></details></div><div><details data-slot="active_goals" data-slot-state="empty" data-stale="false"><summary><span><span id="world-slot-active_goals">Goals in flight</span><span>Read just now</span></span></summary><p>No goal is ready or executing. Go