 a failed task.</p><p><span>Stale</span> Last good data from 15 min ago:</p><ul><li data-record="fixture-task-1" data-outcome="running"><span>Draft the launch page outline</span><span><span>Running</span> · developer__shell</span></li></ul><div><button class="pa-btn pa-btn--ghost"><span class="pa-btn__label">Try again</span></button></div></details></div><div><details data-slot="active_goals" data-slot-state="error" data-stale="true"><summary><span><span id="world-slot-active_goals">Goals in flight</span><span>Disconnected</span></span></summary><p data-failure="disconnected">Can’t reach the daemon. This is a lost connection, not a failed task.</p><p><span>Stale</span> Last good data from 15 min ago:</p><p>All goals that are ready or executing — not only the orchestrator’s.</p><ul><li data-record="fixture-goal-1" data-phase="executing"><span>Draft the launch page outline</span><span>Executing · owned by git_steward · updated 19 min ago</span><span><button class="pa-btn pa-btn--bare"><span class="pa-btn__label">Open goal</span></button></span></li></ul><div><button class="pa-btn pa-btn--ghost"><span class="pa-btn__label">Try again</span></button></div></details><details data-slot="decisions" data-slot-state="error" data-stale="true"><summary><span><span id="world-slot-decisions">Waiting for your review</span><span>Disconnected</span></span></summary><p data-failure="disconnected">Can’t reach the daemon. This is a lost connection, not a failed task.</p><p><span>Stale</span> Last known answer (15 min ago): nothing. That may have changed.</p><div><button class="pa-btn pa-btn--ghost"><span class="pa-btn__label">Try again</span></button></div></details></div></div></div>"`;

