exports[`Arrival table — conformance > DOM snapshots per fixture state > 1280x800 · 10-disconnect_replay 1`] = `"<div role="dialog" aria-modal="false" aria-labelledby=":id:" aria-describedby=":id:" data-world-place="commons" data-compact="false" data-reduced-motion="false"><header><div><p>The work folio on the arrival table</p><h2 id=":id:" tabindex="-1">Arrival table</h2><p>Host: Orchestrator — the orchestrator; selecting another agent adds context, it does not assign them</p><p role="alert" data-state-tone="error"><span aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Daemon unreachable — a lost connection, not a failed task. Showing the last good data, marked stale.</span></p></div><button aria-label="Close Arrival table" class="pa-btn pa-btn--bare"><span class="pa-btn__label">×</span></button></header><dl data-orchestrator-facts="stale" aria-label="Orchestrator: current state"><div data-fact="configured" data-value="unknown"><dt>Configured</dt><dd>Not reported (stale)</dd><dd>The status route does not report model configuration.</dd></div><div data-fact="reachable" data-value="reachable"><dt>Reachable</dt><dd>Reachable (stale)</dd><dd>Status route answered: working.</dd></div><div data-fact="ready" data-value="unknown"><dt>Ready</dt><dd>Unconfirmed (stale)</dd><dd>A reachable daemon is not proof a model can answer.</dd></div><div data-fact="activelyUsed" data-value="active_now"><dt>Actively used</dt><dd>Working now (stale)</dd><dd>Using developer__shell now.</dd></div></dl><div><button data-place-primary="true" data-action="prepare_brief" aria-describedby=":id:" aria-expanded="false" class="pa-btn pa-btn--primary"><span class="pa-btn__label">Prepare a brief</span></button><div role="group" aria-label="More actions"><button data-action="sit_together" title="Changes seating and camera only. Voice is a separate control; text stays available." class="pa-btn pa-btn--ghost"><span class="pa-btn__label">Sit together</span></button><button data-action="review_decision" title="Opens the Decision Inbox. Nothing is approved from the World." class="pa-btn pa-btn--ghost"><span class="pa-btn__label">Review a decision</span></button><button data-action="resume_conversation" title="Opens the canonical shared chat. Offered only when a real session exists." class="pa-btn pa-btn--ghost"><span class="pa-btn__label">Resume conversation</span></button><button data-action="open_profile" title="Shows the shared agent profile: what it can do, what was reported, and the evidence." class="pa-btn pa-btn--ghost"><span class="pa-btn__label">Open profile</span></button><button data-action="explore_places" title="Opens the Places list. Every place works without walking." class="pa-btn pa-btn--ghost"><span class="pa-btn__label">Explore places</span></button></div><p id=":id:">Write the outcome, context, constraints and what would count as done. Nothing is sent until you choose Send. Escape closes the most recent layer.</p></div><div><div><section aria-labelledby="world-slot-orchestrator" data-slot="orchestrator" data-slot-state="error" data-stale="true"><h4><span><span id="world-slot-orchestrator">Orchestrator status</span><span>Disconnected</span></span></h4><p data-failure="disconnected">Can’t reach the daemon. This is a lost connection, not a failed task.</p><p><span>Stale</span> Last good data from 15 min ago:</p><p>Orchestrator reports “working”, using developer__shell · 1 task(s) in flight.</p><div role="group" aria-label="Continue with"><button data-record="fixture-session-1" class="pa-btn pa-btn--ghost"><span class="pa-btn__label">Continue with “Plan the garden launch page”</span></button></div><div><button class="pa-btn pa-btn--ghost"><span class="pa-btn__label">Try again</span></button></div></section><section aria-labelledby="world-slot-requests" data-slot="requests" data-slot-state="error" data-stale="true"><h4><span><span id="world-slot-requests">Recent requests</span><span>Disconnected</span></span></h4><p data-failure="disconnected">Can’t reach the daemon. This is a lost connection, not a failed task.</p><p><span>Stale</span> Last good data from 15 min ago:</p><ul><li data-record="fixture-task-1" data-outcome="running"><span>Draft the launch page outline</span><span><span>Running</span> · developer__shell</span></li></ul><div><button class="pa-btn pa-btn--ghost"><span class="pa-btn__label">Try again</span></button></div></section></div><div><section aria-labelledby="world-slot-active_goals" data-slot="active_goals" data-slot-state="error" data-stale="true"><h4><span><span id="world-slot-active_goals">Goals in flight</span><span>Disconnected</span></span></h4><p data-failure="disconnected">Can’t reach the daemon. This is a lost connection, not a failed task.</p><p><span>Stale</span> Last good data from 15 min ago:</p><p>All goals that are ready or executing — not only the orchestrator’s.</p><ul><li data-record="fixture-goal-1" data-phase="executing"><span>Draft the launch page outline</span><span>Executing · owned by git_steward · updated 19 min ago</span><span><button class="pa-btn pa-btn--bare"><span class="pa-btn__label">Open goal</span></button></span></li></ul><div><button class="pa-btn pa-btn--ghost"><span class="pa-btn__label">Try again</span></button></div></section><section aria-labelledby="world-slot-decisions" data-slot="decisions" data-slot-state="error" data-stale="true"><h4><span><span id="world-slot-decisions">Waiting for your review</span><span>Disconnected</span></span></h4><p data-failure="disconnected">Can’t reach the daemon. This is a lost connection, not a failed task.</p><p><span>Stale</span> Last known answer (15 min ago): nothing. That may have changed.</p><div><button class="pa-btn pa-btn--ghost"><span class="pa-btn__label">Try again</span></button></div></section></div></div></div>"`;
